!.hermes/PROJECT_STATUS.md
!.hermes/DECISIONS.md
!.hermes/plans/
!.hermes/plans/*.md
!.hermes/handoffs/
!.hermes/handoffs/*.md

# Electron user data if created inside the project
user-data/

# Temporary captures or diagnostics
*.har
*.trace
screenshots/
